      {
        "id": "cmobji2qb0002mgrvrnp34gau",
        "conversationId": "cmobji2nc0001mgrvyoq4gwe1",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "Lately I've been thinking a lot about my family. My dad has been on my mind.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-18T13:51:40.053Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji2t70003mgrv4i0oxwum",
        "conversationId": "cmobji2nc0001mgrvyoq4gwe1",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Tell me more about your family. Who are you closest to, and why?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-18T13:51:55.053Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji2w40004mgrvewid7hu2",
        "conversationId": "cmobji2nc0001mgrvyoq4gwe1",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "My mom has been stressed too, and I'm worried about both of them. My brother lives far away so I'm the one checking in.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-18T13:52:25.053Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji2z10005mgrvis923g9n",
        "conversationId": "cmobji2nc0001mgrvyoq4gwe1",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "What does your relationship with them usually look like day to day?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-18T13:52:40.053Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji31z0006mgrvewn16fhk",
        "conversationId": "cmobji2nc0001mgrvyoq4gwe1",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "When I talk to my dad I feel both love and frustration. He's proud of me but we never really dig into the hard stuff.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-18T13:53:10.053Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji3540007mgrvckbkf0mr",
        "conversationId": "cmobji2nc0001mgrvyoq4gwe1",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "When you think about family, what feelings come up first?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-18T13:53:25.053Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji6wb000qmgrvyukwdd4p",
        "conversationId": "cmobji6tg000pmgrvmrjqwv0v",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "Work has been a lot. My boss dropped a big project on me with no warning and now I'm overwhelmed.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-20T13:51:45.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji6zh000rmgrvituj6svf",
        "conversationId": "cmobji6tg000pmgrvmrjqwv0v",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "How do you feel walking into work most mornings?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-20T13:52:00.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji72l000smgrv3s5qcc50",
        "conversationId": "cmobji6tg000pmgrvmrjqwv0v",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "My coworker Sarah has been helpful, but I can tell she's stressed too. The whole team feels anxious.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-20T13:52:30.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji75p000tmgrv72ydmb67",
        "conversationId": "cmobji6tg000pmgrvmrjqwv0v",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "How do you feel walking into work most mornings?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-20T13:52:45.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji78j000umgrvjnoim6l3",
        "conversationId": "cmobji6tg000pmgrvmrjqwv0v",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "I love what I do most days, but this week I feel drained. I keep thinking about quitting.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-20T13:53:15.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji7bi000vmgrv822ifu72",
        "conversationId": "cmobji6tg000pmgrvmrjqwv0v",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "When was the last time you felt this strongly before?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-20T13:53:30.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji9q10016mgrv8tqka4bb",
        "conversationId": "cmobji9my0015mgrvlva6gxvz",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "I had dinner with my partner last night and it was the calmest I've felt in weeks. Grateful for them.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T13:51:49.114Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji9t50017mgrv9f2j8h00",
        "conversationId": "cmobji9my0015mgrvlva6gxvz",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "What would it mean to hold onto this feeling longer?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T13:52:04.114Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji9wa0018mgrvfjbl16t6",
        "conversationId": "cmobji9my0015mgrvlva6gxvz",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "We talked about our future and what we both want. I feel so much love when we have those conversations.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T13:52:34.114Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobji9zf0019mgrvxk4tzrw6",
        "conversationId": "cmobji9my0015mgrvlva6gxvz",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "What would it mean to hold onto this feeling longer?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T13:52:49.114Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobjia2c001amgrvjesbvekq",
        "conversationId": "cmobji9my0015mgrvlva6gxvz",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "A close friend is going through a hard time and I'm trying to be there for them without losing myself.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T13:53:19.114Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobjia5d001bmgrva3ovycs3",
        "conversationId": "cmobji9my0015mgrvlva6gxvz",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Are there friendships you wish were deeper?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-22T13:53:34.114Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobjicgt001kmgrv2m1l77ui",
        "conversationId": "cmobjicdw001jmgrvt7lud9zv",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "Been trying to get back into running. My health has been on my mind — I know I need to take better care of myself.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-23T11:51:52.675Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobjicjz001lmgrvaoigu06y",
        "conversationId": "cmobjicdw001jmgrvt7lud9zv",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "How has your body been feeling lately?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-23T11:52:07.675Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobjicmq001mmgrvfyocrsh8",
        "conversationId": "cmobjicdw001jmgrvt7lud9zv",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "I feel proud when I actually go for the run, but most days I just don't. Then I feel frustrated with myself.",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-23T11:52:37.675Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmobjicq0001nmgrvet62vnpk",
        "conversationId": "cmobjicdw001jmgrvt7lud9zv",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "What would it mean to hold onto this feeling longer?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-23T11:52:52.675Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmoc70k4s000004jy4rkwdqpd",
        "conversationId": "cmobjicdw001jmgrvt7lud9zv",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "maybe setting a running routine would help?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-24T00:49:23.692Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmoc70myt000104jyy2ztrtc9",
        "conversationId": "cmobjicdw001jmgrvt7lud9zv",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "You’re circling a real tension: you know structure might help, but right now it’s more idea than habit. When you picture a routine that might actually stick, what part of the day feels most honest for it?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-24T00:49:27.366Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof0yp9x000104kvy2ch6lkc",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "I am at a coffee shop now",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:23:17.877Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof0yt5t000204kv2eqxqkmc",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "You're in a small in-between place right now, not fully at home or at work. What usually brings you to a coffee shop like this — focus, escape, habit, or something else?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:23:22.913Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof10fv8000004juq6zs3tog",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "I'm talking to my brother about what we are building",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:24:38.996Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof10i4t000104ju0tng9i8j",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "You’re not just passing time there — this sounds like a real conversation about something shared with your brother. Family is already a meaningful part of your map, and your brother now seems tied to building something with you; what are the two of you trying to build?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:24:41.933Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof13ez0000404kv9n3ja955",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "can you create a node that is titled Writing",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:26:57.804Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof13h59000504kvc1pdb28v",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Yes — Writing belongs on the map if it names something real in your life. What kind of place does writing have for you right now: work, craft, outlet, or something else?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:27:00.621Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof13pzc000204juf9njg2ro",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "Writing is my hobby",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:27:12.072Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof13snm000304ju8m12jzz7",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Writing has a clear place in your life — not as work, but as something you do for its own sake. What does writing give you that the rest of your life doesn’t?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:27:15.538Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof14pbp000404juwy4feupo",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "I love writing, can you store that in your mind",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:27:57.877Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof14rpd000504juuh3njam4",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "That lands clearly: writing isn’t just a hobby for you, it’s something you love. We’ve already placed Writing in your life, and now it carries more weight; what do you love most about it when you’re in it?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:28:00.961Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof16a8l000604kvsxxm6ao1",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "Writing is something I do constantly, its so good",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:29:11.637Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof16c0m000704kvj6c7olld",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Writing sounds less like an occasional hobby and more like a steady thread in your days. You’ve named both the habit and the love in it now; when do you notice yourself reaching for writing most often?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:29:13.942Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof1l103000f04kv5ceirdmr",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "I am trying to build out my career around writings..",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:40:39.507Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof1l3of000g04kvf9pqqhxv",
        "conversationId": "cmof0yoxy000004kvv5gpz5c8",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Writing is starting to shift from something you love into something you’re trying to organize your work around. That adds a real tension with Work already on your map; what would it mean, concretely, for writing to become your career?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:40:42.975Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof1m8l2000i04kvtugnzyix",
        "conversationId": "cmof1m8d1000h04kvnx9i0c6g",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "I am really focused on health",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:41:35.990Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof1maxu000j04kvtqfyv4bb",
        "conversationId": "cmof1m8d1000h04kvnx9i0c6g",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Health is taking up real attention right now, not just sitting in the background. You’ve mentioned it before as one of the main domains in your life; what in health feels most active at the moment — your body, your habits, or your worry about it?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:41:39.042Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof1yfwm000o04kvhxlj94b6",
        "conversationId": "cmof1m8d1000h04kvnx9i0c6g",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "I walk daily can you add that to the map",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:51:05.350Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof1yi5o000p04kvzjydehsg",
        "conversationId": "cmof1m8d1000h04kvnx9i0c6g",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Daily walking sounds like a real practice, not a passing intention. Since you want it on the map, I’d add it under Health as a stable habit; what does that walk do for you when you keep it?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:51:08.268Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof1yrpy000q04kvkaccs45c",
        "conversationId": "cmof1m8d1000h04kvnx9i0c6g",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "Yes please add it",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:51:20.662Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof1yttz000r04kvqww7izmg",
        "conversationId": "cmof1m8d1000h04kvnx9i0c6g",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "I’ll treat daily walking as a stable health habit and add it to the map. When you think about that walk, is it mainly for your body, your mind, or the structure it gives your day?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:51:23.399Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof1z7vo000s04kvqcuu0m0m",
        "conversationId": "cmof1m8d1000h04kvnx9i0c6g",
        "role": "user",
        "content": "I walk for health and for my body. It's critical",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:51:41.604Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "cmof1zbuu000t04kvmapp4xmp",
        "conversationId": "cmof1m8d1000h04kvnx9i0c6g",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "This sounds less like a preference and more like a non-negotiable part of how you take care of yourself. That makes Daily Walking feel like a strong fit under Health; has it become critical because of something specific in your body, or because you’ve learned what happens when you stop?",
        "createdAt": "2026-04-26T00:51:46.758Z"
      }
